        <div>Sentences: <strong>13</strong></div>
        <div>Paragraphs: <strong>6</strong></div>
        <div>Reading <strong>0h 0m</strong></div>
        <div>time: <strong>44s</strong></div>
        <button class="more btn" id="fewerButton">Show fewer stats ⌃</button>
      </div>
