        <div class="card red-card"><span class="count">1</span>of 13 sentences is<br>very hard to read.<button class="eye btn" data-type="red">◉</button></div>
        <div class="card yellow-card"><span class="count">1</span>of 13 sentences is<br>hard to read.<button class="eye btn" data-type="yellow">◉</button></div>
        <div class="card green-card">Find grammar and spelling<br>issues with Editor Plus.<br><span class="upgrade btn">Upgrade</span></div>
        <div class="card blue-card"><span class="count">2</span>weakeners.<button class="eye btn" data-type="blue">◉</button><br><a href="#" class="btn">View details</a></div>
        <div class="card purple-card"><span class="count">1</span>word with a simpler<br>alternative.<button class="eye btn" data-type="purple">◉</button></div>
